  {t="N", seg=3, arg="Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar", text="Wait on Zapetta's side of the tower. The zeppelin at the other platform (Hin Denburg) goes to Grom'gol in Stranglethorn, so do not board that one. The Orgrimmar zeppelin lands at the tower in Durotar, just outside Orgrimmar."},
