  {t="N", seg=5, arg="Ride the zeppelin from the Orgrimmar tower to Tirisfal Glades", text="You start at the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar with Report to Anastasia in your log. Take the Undercity zeppelin, not the Grom'gol one. If you skipped Hadric Harlson's two Argent Dawn quests in segment 3, his camp is just east of the Tirisfal tower (65.9, 61.0); your log has room for both."},
  {t="N", seg=5, arg="Walk south into the Ruins of Lordaeron and take an elevator down into the Undercity"},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={1959}, names={"Report to Anastasia"}, text="Anastasia Hartwell, in the Magic Quarter", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=85, y=10.1},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={1960}, names={"Investigate the Alchemist Shop"}, text="Anastasia Hartwell", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=85, y=10.1},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={1960,1960}, obj={2,3}, names={"Investigate the Alchemist Shop","Investigate the Alchemist Shop"}, text="Don't leave without these: click the Chest of Containment Coffers and the Cantation of Manifestation (a book) on the ground right behind Anastasia. Nothing happens at the shop without them.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=85.1, y=10.0},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={366}, names={"Return the Book"}, text="Bethor Iceshard, a few steps from Anastasia", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=84.1, y=17.4},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={1960}, obj={1}, names={"Investigate the Alchemist Shop"}, text="Algernon's shop in the Apothecarium. Read the Cantation there to make the invisible Rift Spawns appear. Fight one until it stops fighting back, then use the Chest of Containment Coffers next to it and loot the Filled Containment Coffer. Do this 3 times.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=52.8, y=75.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={5725}, names={"The Power to Destroy..."}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=56.3, y=92.2, dg=1},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={1960}, names={"Investigate the Alchemist Shop"}, text="Back to Anastasia Hartwell. Do not take her next quest (Gathering Materials) yet: you take it when you come back from Gunther.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=85, y=10.5},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={366}, names={"Return the Book"}, text="Leave the Undercity and go north past Brill. Swim out to Gunther Arcanus on the island of Gunther's Retreat.", zone="Tirisfal Glades", map=1420, x=68.2, y=41.9},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={409}, names={"Proving Allegiance"}, text="Gunther Arcanus", zone="Tirisfal Glades", map=1420, x=68.2, y=41.9},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={409}, names={"Proving Allegiance"}, text="You need one free quest-log slot here: the Crate of Candles and Lillith's Dinner Table each open a small quest that you accept and hand in on the spot. Click the Crate of Candles next to Gunther (Candles of Beckoning) for a Candle of Beckoning. Swim to the ruined house on the shore south-west of the island and click Lillith's Dinner Table (The Dormant Shade): Lillith Nefara (level 12) appears. Kill her.", zone="Tirisfal Glades", map=1420, x=66.6, y=44.9},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={409}, names={"Proving Allegiance"}, text="Gunther Arcanus", zone="Tirisfal Glades", map=1420, x=68.2, y=42},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={411}, names={"The Prodigal Lich Returns"}, text="Gunther Arcanus", zone="Tirisfal Glades", map=1420, x=68.2, y=42},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={411}, names={"The Prodigal Lich Returns"}, text="Back into the Undercity: Bethor Iceshard in the Magic Quarter", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=84.1, y=17.2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={1961}, names={"Gathering Materials"}, text="Anastasia Hartwell, a few steps from Bethor. Needs 10 Linen Cloth and 6 Dalaran Mana Gems. Stop making Linen Bandages until this is handed in; the Dalaran humans in Silverpine drop more linen.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=85.1, y=10.0},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=5, text="The mage trainers stand next to Bethor in the Magic Quarter: learn your level 16 spells (Flamestrike) if you have not yet"},
  {t="FLY", seg=5, arg="The Sepulcher", text="Bat handler Michael Garrett in the Trade Quarter"},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={6324}, names={"Return to Podrig"}, text="Deathguard Podrig. Skip Tabitha Heartweaver's A Frightened Request: it is done inside the Ruins of Lordaeron dungeon. Keep Mura Runetotem in your log: the route hands it in at the start of segment 7.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=43.5, y=41.7},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={443}, names={"Rot Hide Ichor"}, text="High Executor Hadrec. Leave Shadow Priest Allister's Ambermill Investigations for your next visit, right before you go to Ambermill.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=43.4, y=40.9},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={423}, names={"Arugal's Folly"}, text="Moonrage Gluttons (Glutton Shackles) and Moonrage Darksouls (Darksoul Shackles) roam the woods just north of the Sepulcher. If you are short on Darksouls, more stand by the lake shore at 58-60, 41-42, a short way south of the Decrepit Ferry. Do not go back to the Sepulcher yet.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=41.5, y=27.5},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={443}, names={"Rot Hide Ichor"}, text="Run east to the Decrepit Ferry on the lake shore (58, 35) and swim across to Fenris Isle. Rot Hide Brutes and Plague Weavers on the southern half of the isle drop the ichor. The Savages and Raging Rot Hides around Fenris Keep at the north end (65-66, 23-25) are level 18-19, so pull them one at a time.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=67.0, y=31.0, path={{40.4,24.7},{43.2,22.6},{43.2,19.3},{44.2,17.8},{46.4,17.8},{52.0,19.3},{56.2,24.4},{59.6,25.6},{63.0,31.0}}},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={460}, names={"Resting in Pieces"}, text="Every rot hide can drop A Talking Head (rare). If you loot it, right-click it to start this quest. If it never drops, skip the Resting in Pieces, Hidden Niche and Wand to Bethor steps (not Rot Hide Origins).", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=66.0, y=27.0},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={460}, names={"Resting in Pieces"}, text="The Shallow Grave near the stable on the east side of Fenris Keep", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=67.9, y=25},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={461}, names={"The Hidden Niche"}, text="From the Shallow Grave", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=67.9, y=25},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={461}, names={"The Hidden Niche"}, text="The Dusty Shelf in the south-west tower of the keep. Thule Ravenclaw (level 24 elite) stands inside the keep at 65.7, 23.7, and the Rot Hide Bruiser (level 22 rare) at 64.7, 23.1. Clear the Savages at the door one at a time, loot the shelf and leave. Do not pull either of them.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=65.4, y=24.9},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={491}, names={"Wand to Bethor"}, text="From the Dusty Shelf. Keep the Woven Wand for Bethor.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=65.4, y=24.9},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={443}, names={"Rot Hide Ichor"}, text="Swim back west to the ferry and return to the Sepulcher: Apothecary Renferrel. Do not take Rot Hide Origins yet: you take it on your last visit, right before you fly to the Undercity.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=42.9, y=40.9},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={423}, names={"Arugal's Folly"}, text="Dalar Dawnweaver", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=44.1, y=39.8},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={424}, names={"Arugal's Folly"}, text="Dalar Dawnweaver. If she also offers Stop the Spread (new in Forever), leave it: it is for a later segment.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=44.1, y=39.8},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={479}, names={"Ambermill Investigations"}, text="Shadow Priest Allister", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=44, y=40.8},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={424}, names={"Arugal's Folly"}, text="Head east to Grimson the Pale (level 15) near the lake shore, a short way south of the Decrepit Ferry. He stands with a pack of Moonrage worgen: pull the worgen around him first, then loot his head.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=58.6, y=44.9},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={479,1961}, names={"Ambermill Investigations","Gathering Materials"}, text="Ambermill, to the south. Work the west and south side of the village (58-61, 62-67): Dalaran Protectors and Mages drop the pendants, and they and every other Dalaran human drop mana gems and linen. Stay away from the tower at the east end (63, 64): Archmage Ataeric (22), a Dalaran Spellscribe (21) and the Conjurors and Warders (16-18) stand there; Ataeric is for a later quest. Dalaran Wizards (19-20) and Watchers (18-19) hold the east side and the road south of the village: leave them for now (they are for Watching the Roads, which you finish at 21). Flamestrike and Arcane Explosion work well on the Protector and Mage packs; Frost Nova casters that reach melee range.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=59.5, y=64.5},
  {t="L", seg=5, lvl=17, text="If you are not 17 yet, keep pulling the Dalaran Protector and Mage packs on the west side of Ambermill (Flamestrike + Arcane Explosion). They also drop more linen and mana gems.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=59.5, y=65.0},
  {t="C", seg=5, q={450}, names={"A Recipe For Death"}, text="OPTIONAL (1,350 XP), daytime only. From Ambermill go south-west to Pyrewood Village. Berard's Bookshelf is inside the inn, the big building at the WEST end of the village: come in from the west side so you only meet one or two guards, and loot the journal. The villagers are level 13-15 elites: Polymorph one, Frost Nova and kite the other. Between 9 in the evening and 9 in the morning (server time) they are worgen and hit much harder: then press Skip and skip the hand-in below too", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=43.0, y=73.2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={424}, names={"Arugal's Folly"}, text="Dalar Dawnweaver. Skip her other quests: Pyrewood Shackles (Arugal's Folly) is elite and Stop the Spread is for a later segment.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=44.2, y=39.8},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={479}, names={"Ambermill Investigations"}, text="Shadow Priest Allister. Leave The Weaver for a later visit. If Watching the Roads is not in your log, take it from him now (your log has room).", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=44, y=40.8},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={92401}, names={"A Frightened Request"}, text="Tabitha Heartweaver at the Sepulcher. Look for her husband Edward in the dungeon.", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=44.4, y=43.0, dg=2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={450}, names={"A Recipe For Death"}, text="Apothecary Renferrel, only if you looted Berard's Journal (otherwise press Skip). Do not take the next part: its Hardened Tumor is a 5% drop from the lake murlocs", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=42.8, y=40.9},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={444}, names={"Rot Hide Origins"}, text="Apothecary Renferrel", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=42.9, y=40.9},
  {t="FLY", seg=5, arg="Undercity", text="Karos Razok, the bat handler at the Sepulcher. You land in the Trade Quarter: if you are still short of 10 Linen Cloth, buy the rest at the auction house there before you walk to the Magic Quarter."},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={444}, names={"Rot Hide Origins"}, text="Bethor Iceshard in the Magic Quarter", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=84.1, y=17.1},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={491}, names={"Wand to Bethor"}, text="Only if you found A Talking Head on Fenris Isle: give Bethor the Woven Wand. Otherwise skip this step.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=84.1, y=17.1},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={446}, names={"Thule Ravenclaw"}, text="Bethor Iceshard", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=84.1, y=17.4},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={1961}, names={"Gathering Materials"}, text="Josef Gregorian, the tailor in the Magic Quarter", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=70.8, y=30.7},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={1962}, names={"Spellfire Robes"}, text="Josef Gregorian", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=70.8, y=30.7},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={92421}, names={"Light's Justice"}, text="Morbin Lightbane in the Royal Quarter. Collect 25 Intact Limbs in the Ruins of Lordaeron.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=57.8, y=89.8, dg=2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={95216}, names={"The New Plague"}, text="Theodore Griffs in the Apothecarium. The Highly Toxic Strain drops from Witherfang.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=46.6, y=71.4, dg=2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={1013}, names={"The Book of Ur"}, text="Keeper Bel'dugur in the Apothecarium. The Book of Ur is on a bookshelf near the end of the keep.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=53.7, y=54.5, dg=4},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={1962}, names={"Spellfire Robes"}, text="Josef Gregorian. Put on the Lesser Spellfire Robes.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=70.9, y=30.1},
  {t="N", seg=5, arg="Optional dungeon: Ruins of Lordaeron, levels 15-20", text="The entrance is in the ruined city above the Undercity. Inside: The Baron drops an Abominable Head that starts Unending Torment, and a Crest of Lordaeron lies in a tower near Bjork or on the wall of the small temple at the far end (it moves) and starts a quest too. Quests you picked up for it: Light's Justice, The New Plague, The Wrath of Rath'mael, A Frightened Request.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=72.4, y=11.4, dg=2, run=true},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={92421}, names={"Light's Justice"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=57.8, y=89.8, dg=2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={95216}, names={"The New Plague"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=46.6, y=71.4, dg=2},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={97288}, names={"Unending Torment"}, text="Bring the Abominable Head to Master Apothecary Faranell.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=48.6, y=68.8, dg=2},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={97289}, names={"Unending Torment"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=48.6, y=68.8, dg=2, req=97288},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={97289}, names={"Unending Torment"}, text="Put the head next to the Unfinished Abomination in the next room.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=45.9, y=61.8, dg=2, req=97289},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={97290}, names={"Unending Torment"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=45.9, y=61.8, dg=2, req=97289},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={97290}, names={"Unending Torment"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=48.6, y=68.8, dg=2, req=97290},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={97291}, names={"Unending Torment"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=48.6, y=68.8, dg=2, req=97290},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={97291}, names={"Unending Torment"}, text="Get a Toxic Skullcap from Tawny Grisette in the Trade Quarter, Blisterweed by the herbalism trainer and Essence of Agony from the poison vendor in the Rogues' Quarter, then return to Faranell.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=48.6, y=68.8, dg=2, req=97291},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={97292}, names={"Unending Torment"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=48.6, y=68.8, dg=2, req=97291},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={97292}, names={"Unending Torment"}, text="Use the Hissing Serum on the pipes above the abomination, then return to Faranell.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=48.6, y=68.8, dg=2, req=97292},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={95204}, names={"Crest of Lordaeron"}, text="Crest of Lordaeron: Oran Snakewrithe.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=73.2, y=32.8, dg=2},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=5, text="Only if you are already 18: learn your level 18 spells next to Bethor. Most players are about 17 here; then skip this step. There is no mage trainer on the next segment's path, so you learn the level 18 spells together with the level 20 spells in Thunder Bluff at its end."},
  {t="FLY", seg=5, arg="The Sepulcher", text="Michael Garrett in the Trade Quarter"},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={446}, names={"Thule Ravenclaw"}, text="Apothecary Renferrel", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=42.9, y=40.9},
  {t="A", seg=5, q={448}, names={"Report to Hadrec"}, text="Apothecary Renferrel", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=42.9, y=40.9},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={448}, names={"Report to Hadrec"}, text="High Executor Hadrec. Skip Assault on Fenris Isle (elite) and Deathstalkers in Shadowfang (dungeon).", zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=43.4, y=40.9},
  {t="T", seg=5, q={92401}, names={"A Frightened Request"}, zone="Silverpine Forest", map=1421, x=44.4, y=43.0, dg=2},
  {t="H", seg=5, arg="Crossroads", text="Your hearthstone is still set to the Crossroads; the next segment starts there."},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={881}, names={"Echeyakee"}, text="Sergra Darkthorn. She gives you the Horn of Echeyakee", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={867}, names={"Harpy Raiders"}, text="Darsok Swiftdagger", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.6, y=30.9},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={3281}, names={"Stolen Silver"}, text="Gazrog. The silver lies in a raptor nest at the Raptor Grounds; you get it on loop 2", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.9, y=30.3},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={881}, names={"Echeyakee"}, text="Run north-east from the Crossroads to the giant kodo bones. Blow the Horn of Echeyakee there; the white lion comes to you. Kill it and loot its hide", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=55.6, y=17.2},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={867}, names={"Harpy Raiders"}, text="Witchwing harpies in the north-west Barrens drop the talons. Stay on the east side of the roost; the Slayers further west hit harder", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=40.5, y=16.5, path={{53.6,16.6},{52.2,19.9},{48.8,21.7},{46.2,25.0},{44.2,25.0},{41.8,21.4}}},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={851,855}, names={"Verog the Dervish","Centaur Bracers"}, text="Only if not finished yet: Kolkar centaurs around Barak's old camp drop the bracers, and Verog appears after enough centaurs in the area die", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=44.0, y=25.0},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={851,855}, names={"Verog the Dervish","Centaur Bracers"}, text="Regthar Deathgate, on the road west of the Crossroads", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.4, y=28.4},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={852}, names={"Hezrul Bloodmark"}, text="Hezrul leads the Kolkar at Lushwater Oasis; he comes on the next loop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=45.4, y=28.4},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={881}, names={"Echeyakee"}, text="Sergra Darkthorn, Crossroads", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={905}, names={"The Angry Scytheclaws"}, text="The feathers drop from any Sunscale raptor; you will pass both raptor areas on the next loop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.2, y=31},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={867}, names={"Harpy Raiders"}, text="Darsok Swiftdagger", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.6, y=30.9},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={875}, names={"Harpy Lieutenants"}, zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=51.6, y=30.9},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={95774}, names={"Her Name Is Olgra"}, text="Mankrik (NEW). You collect the adornments next to his wife's body on the next loop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.0, y=31.6},
  {t="FLY", seg=6, arg="Ratchet"},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={3921,1483}, names={"Wenikee Boltbucket","Ziz Fizziks"}, text="Sputtervalve: Wenikee is in the north Barrens, Ziz Fizziks is at Windshear Crag in Stonetalon", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63, y=37.2},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={865,1069}, names={"Raptor Horns","Deepmoss Spider Eggs"}, text="Mebok Mizzyrix. The raptor horns come next; the spider eggs are in Stonetalon later in this segment", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.4, y=37.6},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={891}, names={"The Guns of Northwatch"}, text="Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=39},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={865,3281}, names={"Raptor Horns","Stolen Silver"}, text="Raptor Grounds, south along the coast road: Sunscale Scytheclaws drop the horns and every Sunscale raptor can drop a feather for The Angry Scytheclaws (get 3). The Stolen Silver lies in a nest at 58.0, 53.9", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=57.0, y=53.0},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={891}, names={"The Guns of Northwatch"}, text="Northwatch Hold: Theramore Marines and Preservers drop the medals. Kill Captain Fairmount (61.9, 54.7), Cannoneer Whessan (60.4, 54.8) and Cannoneer Smythe (63.2, 56.6). Pull one at a time and Frost Nova the rest", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=61.8, y=54.7},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={898}, names={"Free From the Hold"}, text="Gilthares Firebough is a prisoner inside the hold", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.0, y=55.0},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={898}, names={"Free From the Hold"}, text="Tell him you are ready and escort him north up the coast to Ratchet. Marines ambush on the way; keep them off him. If he dies, take the quest from him again", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.0, y=55.0},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={891,898}, names={"The Guns of Northwatch","Free From the Hold"}, text="Captain Brightsun, Ratchet", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.3, y=39.1},
  {t="T", seg=6, q={865}, names={"Raptor Horns"}, text="Mebok Mizzyrix", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.4, y=37.6},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={959}, names={"Trouble at the Docks"}, text="Crane Operator Bigglefuzz in Ratchet. The bottle is on Mad Magglish, a goblin in the cave before the dungeon portal.", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.1, y=37.6, dg=3},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={1491}, names={"Smart Drinks"}, text="Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet, after his Raptor Horns quest. Wailing Essence drops from the ectoplasms in and around the dungeon.", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=62.4, y=37.6, dg=3},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={905}, names={"The Angry Scytheclaws"}, text="Head west to the three Scytheclaw nests south-west of the Stagnant Oasis and use a feather on each", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=52.3, y=46.4},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={95774}, names={"Her Name Is Olgra"}, text="South-west to Mankrik's wife's body (49.3, 50.3): kill the quilboars around it (Mankrik calls them Razormane Raiders) until 4 Olgra's Adornments drop", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=49.6, y=51.4},
  {t="C", seg=6, q={852}, names={"Hezrul Bloodmark"}, text="North to Lushwater Oasis: Hezrul Bloodmark is at the Kolkar camp on the south bank", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=46.0, y=41.1},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={1486}, names={"Deviate Hides"}, text="Nalpak, in the small cave above the dungeon entrance (walk up the hill over the skull-shaped cave mouth).", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=46.0, y=35.7, dg=3},
  {t="A", seg=6, q={1487}, names={"Deviate Eradication"}, text="Ebru, next to Nalpak.", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=46.0, y=35.7, dg=3},
  {t="N", seg=6, arg="Optional dungeon: Wailing Caverns, levels 17-24", text="The entrance is the skull-shaped cave at the oasis south-west of the Crossroads; the portal is at the back of the cave. Nalpak and Ebru, in the small cave above the entrance, give Deviate Hides and Deviate Eradication. Leaders of the Fang needs a short chain first: Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads sends you to Hamuul Runetotem and then Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff. Inside: the last boss, Mutanus the Devourer, drops a Glowing Shard that starts a quest (show it to Sputtervalve in Ratchet, then take it to Falla Sagewind on top of the hill above the cave). Quests you picked up for it: Trouble at the Docks, Smart Drinks, Deviate Hides, Deviate Eradication. Not on your path, only if you want the detour: Leaders of the Fang (Thunder Bluff 76, 32); Serpentbloom (Thunder Bluff 23, 21).", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=46.0, y=36.5, dg=3, run=true},
