  {t="N", seg=11, arg="Teleport: Undercity (or fly from Booty Bay to Grom'gol and take the zeppelin to Undercity if you don't have it)", text="You start in Booty Bay. Keep a few Runes of Teleportation in your bags. Nothing new to train at 31."},
