  {t="A", seg=17, q={2641}, names={"Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient"}, text="Sprinkle. The Violet Tragan grows under water in a small Hinterlands lake.", zone="Tanaris", map=1446, x=51.1, y=26.9},
  {t="N", seg=17, arg="Teleport: Undercity (or fly to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades if you don't have it)"},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2995}, names={"Lines of Communication"}, text="Oran Snakewrithe in the Magic Quarter", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=73.1, y=32.9},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={3341}, names={"Bring the End"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=74.0, y=33.3, dg=11},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={864}, names={"Return to Apothecary Zinge"}, text="Apothecary Zinge in the Apothecarium", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=50.1, y=68.0},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={6522}, names={"An Unholy Alliance"}, text="An Unholy Alliance, if you found the Small Scroll.", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=56.3, y=92.2, dg=11},
  {t="FLY", seg=17, arg="Tarren Mill", text="Bat handler in the Undercity"},
  {t="N", seg=17, arg="Ride east out of Tarren Mill on the road into the Hinterlands", text="Go around Aerie Peak: it is an Alliance town with guards."},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={650}, names={"Ripple Recovery"}, text="Gilveradin Sunchaser camps just south-west of Quel'Danil Lodge (26.7, 48.6). Leave the Venom Bottles in the Witherbark village to the south: that chain needs two extra Tarren Mill trips and ends in an elite quest.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=26.7, y=48.6},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={77}, names={"A Sticky Situation"}, text="Gilveradin Sunchaser. Leave Quel'Danil Lodge, the elf lodge just north-east, alone for now: you clear it once Message to the Wildhammer from Revantusk is in your log.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=26.7, y=48.6},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={3123}, names={"Testing the Vessel"}, text="Ride east along the road. Vicious and Primitive Owlbeasts roam the hills on both sides of it (around 35-46, 43-56). Kill 10 and use the Muisek Vessel on each corpse. Loot them all for Resilient Sinew and Metallic Fragments (Natural Materials).", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=40.0, y=47.0},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={77}, names={"A Sticky Situation"}, text="Follow the road east to Skulk Rock. Loot the Horde Supply Crates around the old Horde camp there. Green Sludges and Jade Oozes guard them.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=57.0, y=41.5},
  {t="F", seg=17, arg="Revantusk Village", text="Keep following the road south-east to Revantusk Village on the coast. Gorkas, the wind rider master", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=81.7, y=81.8, path={{57.0,45.4},{59.8,49.6},{67.2,47.8},{69.4,51.0},{75.7,51.0},{79.1,55.8},{79.1,58.5},{77.9,60.3},{77.5,68.1},{75.5,72.3},{77.9,79.5}}},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={7828,7829,7830}, names={"Stalking the Stalkers","Hunt the Savages","Avenging the Fallen"}, text="Huntsman Markhor", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=79.2, y=79.5},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={7839}, names={"Vilebranch Hooligans"}, text="Smith Slagtree", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=77.2, y=80.1},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={7840}, names={"Lard Lost His Lunch"}, text="Lard", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=78.1, y=81.4},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={7841}, names={"Message to the Wildhammer"}, text="Otho Moji'ko. Skip the Revantusk elite quests (Gammerita, Separation Anxiety, Dark Vessels, Kidnapped Elder Torntusk, the Call to Arms board).", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=79.4, y=79.1},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={7844}, names={"Cannibalistic Cousins"}, text="Mystic Yayo'jin", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=78.8, y=78.2},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={7815}, names={"Snapjaws, Mon!"}, text="Katoom the Angler", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=80.3, y=81.5},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7828,7829,7830}, obj={1,0,0}, names={"Stalking the Stalkers","Hunt the Savages","Avenging the Fallen"}, text="Ride north-west into the central wilds. Silvermane Stalkers, Savage Owlbeasts and the Razorbeak Skylords (one circles near 54, 49, another near 64, 52) all live here. Keep looting owlbeasts for sinew and fragments; Savage Owlbeasts also count for the Muisek Vessel if you are still short.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=60.0, y=50.0, path={{77.9,79.5},{75.5,72.3},{77.7,66.0},{79.1,55.8},{75.7,51.0},{69.4,51.0},{67.2,47.8},{64.0,47.8},{62.8,49.6}}},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7844}, names={"Cannibalistic Cousins"}, text="Ride south-west to the Altar of Zul. Vilebranch Scalpers and Soothsayers camp around it. More Scalpers stand at Agol'watha (53, 40) and Shaol'watha (70, 48) later on the loop.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=47.5, y=66.0},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={2641}, names={"Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient"}, text="The small lake just west of the Altar. Swim to the bottom and pick a Violet Tragan mushroom.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=40.6, y=59.7, path={{46.6,67.5},{44.0,67.5}}},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7828}, obj={2}, names={"Stalking the Stalkers"}, text="Silvermane Howlers roam the hills around the lake. Loot the Primitive Owlbeasts here for sinew and fragments too.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=43.0, y=54.0},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7841,2995}, names={"Message to the Wildhammer","Lines of Communication"}, text="Back at Quel'Danil Lodge: kill 15 of each kind of Highvale elf and burn the three Highvale documents, the Records (32.0, 46.8), the Notes (29.6, 48.7) and the Report (28.6, 46.0). The elves respawn while you work; Blizzard the groups.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=31.5, y=47.5, path={{36.6,47.2}}},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2742}, names={"Rin'ji is Trapped!"}, text="Rin'ji is held inside the lodge (30.7, 46.9). Accept once the lodge is cleared: he starts walking out straight away.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=30.7, y=46.9},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={2742}, names={"Rin'ji is Trapped!"}, text="Escort Rin'ji out of the lodge. Frost Nova anything that jumps him and keep him alive. His secret is far to the east; you pick it up later.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=30.7, y=46.9},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={77}, names={"A Sticky Situation"}, text="Gilveradin Sunchaser", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=26.7, y=48.6},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={81}, names={"Ripple Delivery"}, text="Gilveradin Sunchaser. You hand the barrel in at Orgrimmar in the next segment.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=26.7, y=48.6},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7839}, names={"Vilebranch Hooligans"}, text="Ride back east. Slagtree's Lost Tools lie at one of five Vilebranch spots. Check the two near the robot first: Agol'watha (53.4, 38.7) and Skulk Rock (57.4, 42.5).", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=53.4, y=38.7},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={485}, names={"Find OOX-09/HL!"}, text="Right-click the OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon. The robot lies at the head of the river just west of Agol'watha. No beacon yet? Kill the oozes at Skulk Rock (57, 42) and the Vilebranch at Agol'watha (53, 39) until one drops: Find OOX-09, Rescue OOX-09 and An OOX of Your Own are worth about 17,000 XP together.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=49.4, y=37.7},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={485}, names={"Find OOX-09/HL!"}, text="Homing Robot OOX-09/HL", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=49.4, y=37.7},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={836}, names={"Rescue OOX-09/HL!"}, text="Homing Robot OOX-09/HL", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=49.4, y=37.7},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={836}, names={"Rescue OOX-09/HL!"}, text="Escort the robot east to the shore below the Overlook Cliffs. Kill the ambushers quickly.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=84.0, y=58.0, path={{50.2,36.4},{51.4,41.5},{52.8,41.5},{59.8,49.6},{67.4,47.8},{69.6,51.0},{75.7,51.0},{77.7,54.0},{82.5,55.8}}},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7840}, names={"Lard Lost His Lunch"}, text="Ride north along the coast to Lard's island, just offshore. Click Lard's Picnic Basket; the Vilebranch Kidnappers that show up carry the lunch.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=84.5, y=41.2},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7839}, names={"Vilebranch Hooligans"}, text="Tools not found yet? Check the three Shaol'watha spots on your way back south: 66.4, 44.8; 71.0, 48.7; 72.5, 52.9.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=71.0, y=48.7},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={2742}, names={"Rin'ji is Trapped!"}, text="Ride south-east to the Overlook Cliffs. Rin'ji's Secret is a tablet on the cliff top.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=86.3, y=59.0},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2782}, names={"Rin'ji's Secret"}, text="Take the tablet. You hand it to Oran Snakewrithe in the Undercity in the next segment.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=86.3, y=59.0},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7815}, names={"Snapjaws, Mon!"}, text="Saltwater Snapjaws crawl along this whole coast. Kill them along the shore, then follow it south to Revantusk.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=81.0, y=62.0},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={7828,7829,7830}, names={"Stalking the Stalkers","Hunt the Savages","Avenging the Fallen"}, text="Back in Revantusk: Huntsman Markhor", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=79.2, y=79.5},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={7839}, names={"Vilebranch Hooligans"}, text="Smith Slagtree", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=77.2, y=80.1},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={7840}, names={"Lard Lost His Lunch"}, text="Lard", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=78.1, y=81.4},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={7841}, names={"Message to the Wildhammer"}, text="Otho Moji'ko. Skip Another Message to the Wildhammer: the gryphons it needs are too spread out.", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=79.4, y=79.1},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={7844}, names={"Cannibalistic Cousins"}, text="Mystic Yayo'jin", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=78.8, y=78.2},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={7815}, names={"Snapjaws, Mon!"}, text="Katoom the Angler", zone="The Hinterlands", map=1425, x=80.3, y=81.5},
  {t="H", seg=17, arg="Gadgetzan", text="Hearthstone on cooldown? Teleport: Thunder Bluff and fly to Gadgetzan."},
