  {t="A", seg=17, q={3124}, names={"Hippogryph Muisek"}, text="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=74.4, y=43.4},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={3063}, names={"Vengeance on the Northspring"}, text="Talo Thornhoof. Skip Dark Heart (elite) and The Strength of Corruption (Felwood).", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=76.2, y=43.8},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={7734}, names={"Improved Quality"}, text="Jangdor Swiftstrider", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=74.4, y=42.9},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={3124,3128,3128}, obj={0,3,4}, names={"Hippogryph Muisek","Natural Materials","Natural Materials"}, text="Ride south-west to the Frayfeather Highlands. Kill Frayfeather Hippogryphs, Stagwings, Skystormers or Patriarchs and use the Muisek Vessel on each corpse. Loot them all: stay until you also have 20 Resilient Sinew and 40 Metallic Fragments for Natural Materials (the Hinterlands owlbeasts gave you part of them).", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=55.5, y=67.0, path={{72.8,43.0},{70.6,46.3},{70.6,62.4},{68.2,68.1},{65.8,69.6},{60.4,69.6}}},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={2741}, names={"The Super Egg-O-Matic"}, text="Ride a little further south. Hippogryph Eggs lie in the nests at the south end of the Frayfeather Highlands; take one. Frayfeather Patriarchs guard them.", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=57.3, y=77.0},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={3124}, names={"Hippogryph Muisek"}, text="Back in Camp Mojache: Witch Doctor Uzer'i", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=74.4, y=43.4, path={{61.6,69.9},{65.8,69.6},{69.2,66.6},{70.6,62.4},{70.8,47.8},{72.8,43.3}}},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={3125}, names={"Faerie Dragon Muisek"}, text="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=74.4, y=43.4},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={3125,3128}, obj={0,2}, names={"Faerie Dragon Muisek","Natural Materials"}, text="Sprite Darters in the hills just west of the camp. Use the vessel on each one. They also drop the Encrusted Minerals.", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=68.0, y=47.5},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={3125}, names={"Faerie Dragon Muisek"}, text="Witch Doctor Uzer'i", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=74.4, y=43.4},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={3126}, names={"Treant Muisek"}, text="Witch Doctor Uzer'i. Wandering Forest Walkers are big treants that roam alone; you need three, and they also drop the Splintered Logs. Kill every one you meet on the coming loop.", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=74.4, y=43.4},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2766}, names={"Find OOX-22/FE!"}, text="Ride west. On the way, kill the Forest Walkers that roam near the Grimtotem Compound (74, 39) and in central Feralas (54, 47). Right-click the OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon: the robot is in a small cave at the edge of Feral Scar Vale. No beacon yet? Kill the Feral Scar yetis around the cave and the Vale Screechers on the slopes east of it until one drops: this robot pair and An OOX of Your Own are worth about 16,000 XP together.", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=53.4, y=55.7, path={{53.0,56.1}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={2766}, names={"Find OOX-22/FE!"}, text="Homing Robot OOX-22/FE", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=53.4, y=55.7},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2767}, names={"Rescue OOX-22/FE!"}, text="Homing Robot OOX-22/FE", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=53.4, y=55.7},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={2767}, names={"Rescue OOX-22/FE!"}, text="Escort the robot west to the dock on the Forgotten Coast. Kill the ambushers fast.", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=45.0, y=43.0, path={{54.0,54.3},{53.0,52.8},{53.0,48.7},{49.6,42.1},{46.6,41.5}}},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={7003,7721}, names={"Zapped Giants","Fuel for the Zapping"}, text="Zorbin Fandazzle at the dock (44.8, 43.4)", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=44.8, y=43.4},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7003,7721}, names={"Zapped Giants","Fuel for the Zapping"}, text="Along the coast: Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays drop the cores. Zap the Shore, Wave and Deep Striders with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker, then kill the small zapped giants for the residue.", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=42.5, y=49.0},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={7003,7721}, names={"Zapped Giants","Fuel for the Zapping"}, text="Zorbin Fandazzle. Skip his repeat versions.", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=44.8, y=43.4},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={3063}, names={"Vengeance on the Northspring"}, text="Ride north up the coast to the Northspring harpy nests. Kill 4 of each kind.", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=39.5, y=13.5, path={{46.0,42.4},{46.0,35.2},{43.4,28.0},{43.4,24.4}}},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={3126,3128}, obj={0,1}, names={"Treant Muisek","Natural Materials"}, text="A Forest Walker roams the hills south-east of the harpies. Still short of three? The last one wanders the south near the Frayfeather Highlands (57, 73).", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=44.0, y=23.0},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={7734}, names={"Improved Quality"}, text="Ride east to Rage Scar Hold. Rage Scar Yetis drop the hides. If a Perfect Yeti Hide drops, right-click it and hand it to Jangdor too.", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=53.5, y=31.5},
  {t="H", seg=17, arg="Camp Mojache", text="Hearthstone on cooldown? Ride east back to the camp."},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={3126,3128}, names={"Treant Muisek","Natural Materials"}, text="Witch Doctor Uzer'i. Skip Mountain Giant Muisek (elite).", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=74.4, y=43.4},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={3063}, names={"Vengeance on the Northspring"}, text="Talo Thornhoof", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=76.2, y=43.8},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={7734}, names={"Improved Quality"}, text="Jangdor Swiftstrider", zone="Feralas", map=1444, x=74.4, y=42.9},
  {t="N", seg=17, arg="Optional dungeon: Maraudon, levels 46-55", text="Maraudon is in the west of Desolace, north of Shadowprey Village (fly there from Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff or Camp Mojache). Inside the outer caves, before the portals, Cavindra gives Legends of Maraudon. Quests you picked up for it: Shadowshard Fragments. Not on your path, only if you want the detour: Vyletongue Corruption (Desolace 23, 70); Corruption of Earth and Seed (Desolace 27, 78); Twisted Evils (Desolace 62, 40); The Pariah's Instructions (Desolace 50, 87).", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=29.1, y=62.5, dg=14, run=true},
  {t="N", seg=17, arg="Teleport: Thunder Bluff (or fly there from Camp Mojache if you don't have it)"},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=17, text="Spirit Rise mage trainers: learn the level 48 spells. Still 47? Train what you can; the rest waits for the Undercity trainer in the next segment."},
  {t="FLY", seg=17, arg="Ratchet"},
  {t="N", seg=17, arg="Take the boat from the Ratchet dock to Booty Bay"},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={2874}, names={"Deliver to MacKinley"}, text="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley in Booty Bay", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=27.8, y=77.1},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={648,836,2767}, names={"Rescue OOX-17/TN!","Rescue OOX-09/HL!","Rescue OOX-22/FE!"}, text="Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay. Hand in the robots you rescued.", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=28.4, y=76.3},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={3721}, names={"An OOX of Your Own"}, text="Oglethorpe Obnoticus. Only offered once all three OOX robots are home; otherwise skip this step and the next.", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=28.4, y=76.3},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={3721}, names={"An OOX of Your Own"}, text="Oglethorpe Obnoticus. It has no objectives; the reward is a Mechanical Chicken pet.", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=28.4, y=76.3},
  {t="FLY", seg=17, arg="Stonard", text="Gringer"},
  {t="S", seg=17, arg="Stonard", text="Innkeeper Karakul"},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2784}, names={"Fall From Grace"}, text="Ride south-west out of Stonard to the Fallen Hero of the Horde, a ghost standing by the road that leads south into the Blasted Lands", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=34.3, y=66.1},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={2784}, names={"Fall From Grace"}, text="Listen to his whole story", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=34.3, y=66.1},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2621}, names={"The Disgraced One"}, text="Fallen Hero of the Horde. You hand it in at Stonard at the end.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=34.3, y=66.1},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2581,2583,2585}, names={"Snickerfang Jowls","A Boar's Vitality","The Decisive Striker"}, text="Follow the road south into the Blasted Lands. Bloodmage Drazial stands just inside the pass.", zone="Blasted Lands", map=1419, x=50.5, y=14.2},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2601,2603}, names={"The Basilisk's Bite","Vulture's Vigor"}, text="Bloodmage Lynnore, next to him", zone="Blasted Lands", map=1419, x=50.6, y=14.3},
  {t="C", seg=17, q={2581,2583,2585,2601,2603}, names={"Snickerfang Jowls","A Boar's Vitality","The Decisive Striker","The Basilisk's Bite","Vulture's Vigor"}, text="You need 5 Snickerfang Jowls, 6 Blasted Boar Lungs, 6 Scorpok Pincers, 11 Basilisk Brains and 14 Vulture Gizzards in all. North plain (around 50, 22): Starving Snickerfangs and Scorpok Stingers. North-east (around 60, 30): Ashmane Boars, Redstone Basilisks and Black Slayer vultures. Centre (around 52, 40): Bonepicker vultures and Snickerfang Hyenas.", zone="Blasted Lands", map=1419, x=55.0, y=30.0},
  {t="N", seg=17, arg="If an Imperfect Draenethyst Fragment dropped, take it to Kum'isha the Collector", text="He stands in the centre of the Blasted Lands and gives Everything Counts In Large Amounts (5650 XP) for it. Do not farm for one.", zone="Blasted Lands", map=1419, x=52.0, y=35.6},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={2581,2583,2585}, names={"Snickerfang Jowls","A Boar's Vitality","The Decisive Striker"}, text="Bloodmage Drazial", zone="Blasted Lands", map=1419, x=50.5, y=14.2},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={2601,2603}, names={"The Basilisk's Bite","Vulture's Vigor"}, text="Bloodmage Lynnore", zone="Blasted Lands", map=1419, x=50.6, y=14.3},
  {t="L", seg=17, lvl=48, text="Not 48 yet? Grind the Starving Snickerfangs and Scorpok Stingers on the north plain until you are. The next segment starts at 48.", zone="Blasted Lands", map=1419, x=50.0, y=22.0},
  {t="H", seg=17, arg="Stonard", text="Or ride back north through the Swamp"},
  {t="T", seg=17, q={2621}, names={"The Disgraced One"}, text="Dispatch Commander Ruag in Stonard", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=47.8, y=54.9},
  {t="A", seg=17, q={2622}, names={"The Missing Orders"}, text="Dispatch Commander Ruag. Bengor, also in Stonard, takes it at the start of the next segment.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=47.8, y=54.9},
  {t="N", seg=17, arg="Keep these for the next segment: 32 and 81 (Orgrimmar), 2782 and 2995 (Undercity), 2741 (the Egg-O-Matic in Gadgetzan), 2622 (Stonard)", text="Your hearthstone is set to Stonard."},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={2622}, names={"The Missing Orders"}, text="Bengor in Stonard. He offers The Swamp Talker next: leave it", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=45.0, y=57.4},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Optional dungeon: Sunken Temple, levels 50-60", text="The temple is in the lake in the middle of the Swamp of Sorrows, east of Stonard: swim down through the sunken doorway and follow the halls to the portal. Not on your path, only if you want the detour: Jammal'an the Prophet (The Hinterlands 34, 75). Needs an earlier quest chain this route does not do: The God Hakkar, The Temple of Atal'Hakkar.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=69.9, y=53.5, dg=15, run=true},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={1445}, names={"The Temple of Atal'Hakkar"}, zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=47.9, y=54.8, dg=15},
  {t="FLY", seg=18, arg="Kargath", text="You start in Stonard; your hearthstone is still set there. Breyk, the wind rider master"},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Take the trail that starts just north of Kargath and climbs into Searing Gorge, then cross the gorge north-west to the Cauldron", text="Have 15 Silk Cloth in your bags for an outhouse quest here. There is no Auction House before Undercity."},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3441}, names={"Divine Retribution"}, text="Kalaran Windblade, at the north-west edge of the Cauldron", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=39.1, y=39.0},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={3441}, names={"Divine Retribution"}, text="Listen to his story", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=39.1, y=39.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3442}, names={"The Flawless Flame"}, zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=39.1, y=39.0},
  {t="F", seg=18, arg="Thorium Point", text="Grisha, the Horde wind rider master at Thorium Point", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=34.8, y=30.8},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={7728,7729}, names={"STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass","JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition"}, text="The Wanted board at Thorium Point. Skip WANTED: Overseer Maltorius (elite)", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=37.6, y=26.5},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={7723,7724,7727}, names={"Curse These Fat Fingers","Fiery Menace!","Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It"}, text="Hansel Heavyhands", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=38.6, y=27.8},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={7722}, names={"What the Flux?"}, text="Master Smith Burninate", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=38.8, y=28.5},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={3442,7723}, names={"The Flawless Flame","Curse These Fat Fingers"}, text="Heavy War Golems walk around the Cauldron and drop Golem Oil. Blazing, Inferno and Magma Elementals in and around the Cauldron drop Hearts of Flame (Magma Elementals can drop both). Frost Nova, then Blizzard", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=42.0, y=50.0},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={3442}, names={"The Flawless Flame"}, text="Back to Kalaran Windblade", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=39.1, y=39.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3443}, names={"Forging the Shaft"}, zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=39.1, y=39.0},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={7729,3443,7728}, obj={0,0,1}, names={"JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition","Forging the Shaft","STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass"}, text="Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers on the Cauldron floor. Any Dark Iron dwarf can drop a Thorium Plated Dagger. The Smithing Tuyere drops from the Dark Iron Steamsmiths at the forges on the west side of the Cauldron (40, 49). Keep the Grimesilt Outhouse Key if one drops", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=43.0, y=34.9},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={7727,7722}, names={"Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It","What the Flux?"}, text="The Slag Pit is a tunnel that leads down from the Cauldron floor. Incendosaurs fill its lava pools: kill your 20 first. The Secret Plans: Fiery Flux lie on the ground at 40.5, 35.7, right beside Overseer Maltorius (elite 50) and his two elite Dark Iron Sentries (48). Do not try to clear them. Come in from the side away from them, click the plans, then Frost Nova, Blink and run back up the tunnel", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=47.6, y=25.2},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={7724,7728}, obj={0,2}, names={"Fiery Menace!","STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass"}, text="South of the Cauldron: Dark Iron Lookouts by the sentry towers (33, 54; 36, 61; 43, 63; 50-54, 56-59) drop the Lookout's Spyglass. An elite Dark Iron Sentry (48) guards each tower: pull the Lookouts away from it (the group at 53, 59 stands furthest from its Sentry). Greater Lava Spiders roam the lava pools and plateaus south and west of the Cauldron", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=40.0, y=62.0},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={3443}, names={"Forging the Shaft"}, text="Back north to Kalaran Windblade. Skip The Flame's Casing (elite)", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=39.1, y=39.0},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={7729,7728}, names={"JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition","STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass"}, text="Taskmaster Scrange, Thorium Point", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=39.0, y=27.5},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={7723,7724,7727}, names={"Curse These Fat Fingers","Fiery Menace!","Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It"}, text="Hansel Heavyhands", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=38.6, y=27.8},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={7722}, names={"What the Flux?"}, text="Master Smith Burninate", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=38.8, y=28.5},
  {t="L", seg=18, lvl=50, text="Quest XP runs about two levels short in this segment, so grind to 50 here. You need 50 for Bungle in the Jungle in Gadgetzan and for the level 50 class quest. Kill the level 47-49 mobs: Greater Lava Spiders on the west plateau (27-32, 37-50), and Heavy War Golems and Dark Iron Taskmasters along the west rim of the Cauldron (34-38, 41-48). The level 45-46 Slavers give about a fifth less XP. Skip the elite Dark Iron Sentries at the sentry towers (34, 54 is the closest) and beside Maltorius. Taskmasters drop cloth and the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep the key, you use it at the end of Searing Gorge. Frost Nova, then Blizzard", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=31.0, y=45.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4449}, names={"Caught!"}, text="Ride east to the Wooden Outhouse at the Grimesilt Dig Site (65.6, 62.2) and talk to it. Leave Ledger from Tanaris alone: its items are in Dustwallow and the Swamp of Sorrows", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=65.6, y=62.2},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4449}, names={"Caught!"}, text="Five Dark Iron Geologists dig right next to the outhouse; the other three work at 69, 33, far to the north. There are only eight in the zone: kill the five here, then wait a few minutes for them to come back rather than riding north. Dark Iron Watchmen stand among them. You also need 15 Silk Cloth", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=63.3, y=60.5},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4449}, names={"Caught!"}, zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=65.6, y=62.2},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4451}, names={"The Key to Freedom"}, text="Right-click the Grimesilt Outhouse Key. Still no key? Any Dark Iron Taskmaster or Slaver can drop it: the nearest stand at 58, 42, the rest on the Cauldron floor. Skip this pair if it will not drop", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=65.6, y=62.2},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4451}, names={"The Key to Freedom"}, text="Use the key on the outhouse door", zone="Searing Gorge", map=1427, x=65.6, y=62.2},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Teleport: Undercity from the dig site (or ride back to Thorium Point and fly to the Undercity if you don't have it)"},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=18, text="Undercity Magic Quarter: learn the level 50 spells. With Classic spell timing, Portal: Thunder Bluff also comes at 50. Stock up on about 10 Runes of Teleportation: this segment uses a lot of Teleports"},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={8250}, names={"Magecraft"}, text="Magecraft from Pierce Shackleton, at the mage trainers. Needs level 50. It ends at Sanath Lim-yo in Azshara", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=85.4, y=13.5},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={2782,2995}, names={"Rin'ji's Secret","Lines of Communication"}, text="Oran Snakewrithe", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=73.1, y=32.9},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={8273}, names={"Oran's Gratitude"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=73.1, y=32.9},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={8273}, names={"Oran's Gratitude"}, zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=73.1, y=32.9},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3568}, names={"Seeping Corruption"}, text="Chemist Cuely in the Apothecarium. You fill the vials in Azshara later in this segment", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=48.7, y=71.4},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4294}, names={"... and a Batch of Ooze"}, text="Chemist Fuely, right next to Cuely. The oozes for it live in Un'Goro, where you go next. Leave his Felwood quest (A Sample of Slime...) for your second Undercity stop", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=47.5, y=73.3},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Teleport: Orgrimmar (or take the zeppelin from the tower outside the Undercity if you don't have it)"},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={32}, names={"Rise of the Silithid"}, text="Zilzibin Drumlore in the Drag", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=56.3, y=46.7},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4494}, names={"March of the Silithid"}, text="Zilzibin Drumlore. Needs level 50", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=56.3, y=46.7},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4300}, names={"Bone-Bladed Weapons"}, text="Jes'rimon in the Drag", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=55.5, y=34.1},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={81}, names={"Ripple Delivery"}, text="Dran Droffers, at the east end of the Drag", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=59.5, y=36.6},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={936}, names={"Assisting Arch Druid Runetotem"}, text="Innkeeper Gryshka, Valley of Strength. Do not bind here yet", zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=54.1, y=68.4},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={7068}, names={"Shadowshard Fragments"}, zone="Orgrimmar", map=1454, x=39.2, y=86.3, dg=14},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Buy a Mithril Casing at the Auction House", text="It is an engineering part for the A-Me 01 robot in Un'Goro. If none is for sale, skip Chasing A-Me 01 parts 2 and 3 when you get there"},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Teleport: Thunder Bluff (or fly there from Orgrimmar if you don't have it)"},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={936}, names={"Assisting Arch Druid Runetotem"}, text="Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem on Elder Rise", zone="Thunder Bluff", map=1456, x=78.6, y=28.6},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3761}, names={"Un'Goro Soil"}, text="Collect about 50 Un'Goro Soil in total: 20 for this quest, 5 for Gadgetzan, and 2 for each Morrowgrain attempt later", zone="Thunder Bluff", map=1456, x=78.6, y=28.6},
  {t="FLY", seg=18, arg="Gadgetzan", text="Thunder Bluff flight master, by the elevator"},
  {t="S", seg=18, arg="Gadgetzan", text="Innkeeper Fizzgrimble at the inn. You hearth back here when you leave Un'Goro"},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={2741}, names={"The Super Egg-O-Matic"}, text="The Super Egg-O-Matic machine, next to Andi Lynn: put in the Hippogryph Egg from Feralas. Curgle Cranklehop's egg quests that follow give no XP; skip them", zone="Tanaris", map=1446, x=52.4, y=27.0},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4494}, names={"March of the Silithid"}, text="Alchemist Pestlezugg", zone="Tanaris", map=1446, x=50.9, y=27.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4496}, names={"Bungle in the Jungle"}, zone="Tanaris", map=1446, x=50.9, y=27.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4504}, names={"Super Sticky"}, text="Tran'rek", zone="Tanaris", map=1446, x=51.6, y=26.8},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Optional dungeon: Alcaz Prison, levels 48-53", text="New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is on Alcaz Island, off the north-east coast of Dustwallow Marsh. It has 5 Horde quests (from level 46 to 48), but who gives them is not published yet: ask around Brackenwall Village and take what is offered; the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.", dg=19, run=true},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4290}, names={"The Fare of Lar'korwi"}, text="Ride south-west out of Gadgetzan and down the trail into Un'Goro Crater. Torwa Pathfinder waits at the bottom", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=71.6, y=76.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4289}, names={"The Apes of Un'Goro"}, text="Torwa Pathfinder", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=71.6, y=76.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3844}, names={"It's a Secret to Everybody"}, text="A Wrecked Raft on the shore of the pond north-west of Torwa", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=63.0, y=68.6, path={{71.4,69.3},{69.2,69.3},{65.4,65.7},{63.6,65.7}}},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={3844}, names={"It's a Secret to Everybody"}, text="A Small Pack, a few steps away in the water", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=63.1, y=69.1},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3845}, names={"It's a Secret to Everybody"}, text="Keep it for Linken at Marshal's Refuge", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=63.1, y=69.1},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4290}, names={"The Fare of Lar'korwi"}, text="The Fresh Threshadon Carcass north of Torwa. From now on, loot every Power Crystal (red, green, blue, yellow) and every Un'Goro Dirt Pile you pass", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=68.7, y=56.7},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4290}, names={"The Fare of Lar'korwi"}, zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=71.6, y=76.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4291}, names={"The Scent of Lar'korwi"}, zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=71.6, y=76.0},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4291,4300}, names={"The Scent of Lar'korwi","Bone-Bladed Weapons"}, text="Walk up to the ravasaur eggs west of Torwa and Lar'korwi Mates come out to guard them; they drop the glands. Any ravasaur here can drop White Ravasaur Claws", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=64.0, y=72.0},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4291}, names={"The Scent of Lar'korwi"}, text="He offers The Bait for Lar'korwi next: leave it until you pass him again in loop 2, to save log space", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=71.6, y=76.0},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="From now on kill every ooze you pass until you have 15-20 Un'Goro Slime Samples (for ... and a Batch of Ooze)", text="Primal Oozes sit in the middle of the crater (on your ride north and around the hive), Muculent Oozes in the east jungle (loop 1) and Glutinous Oozes on the west side (loop 2). Not every sample tests as pure and you need 5 that do. They stack"},
  {t="G", seg=18, text="Ride north through the middle of the crater to Marshal's Refuge. Keep looting crystals and soil. Leave the Devilsaurs and Stegodons (elites) alone", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=45.2, y=5.8, path={{72.8,65.7},{76.9,59.4},{76.9,51.3},{75.5,49.3},{74.8,43.9},{67.8,33.4},{66.0,33.1},{61.4,28.0},{59.6,28.0},{54.2,21.7},{51.0,21.7},{46.2,16.0},{45.2,14.5}}},
  {t="F", seg=18, arg="Marshal's Refuge", text="Gryfe", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=45.2, y=5.8},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={3845}, names={"It's a Secret to Everybody"}, text="Linken. He offers It's a Secret to Everybody next: leave it until you are back from loop 2, to save log space", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=44.7, y=8.1},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3881}, names={"Expedition Salvation"}, text="Williden Marshal", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=44.0, y=7.1},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3882}, names={"Roll the Bones"}, text="Spark Nilminer", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=43.5, y=7.4},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4503}, names={"Shizzle's Flyer"}, text="Shizzle", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=44.2, y=11.6},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4145}, names={"Larion and Muigin"}, text="Larion", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=45.5, y=8.7},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4284}, names={"Crystals of Power"}, text="J.D. Collie, in the cave at the north end of the camp. Keep it until you are back from loop 1: you need 7 Power Crystals of each colour, and loop 1 passes plenty of them", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=41.9, y=2.7, path={{42.8,6.4}}, cave=true},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4243}, names={"Chasing A-Me 01"}, text="Karna Remtravel, just south-east of the camp", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=46.4, y=13.4},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4501}, names={"Beware of Pterrordax"}, text="The Beware of Pterrordax sign in the camp", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=43.5, y=8.4},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4504}, names={"Super Sticky"}, text="Ride south to the Lakkari Tar Pits: Tar Beasts, Tar Creepers, Tar Lurkers and Tar Lords drop the tar. Keep looting every Power Crystal you pass", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=50.1, y=23.3},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4145,4145}, obj={1,4}, names={"Larion and Muigin","Larion and Muigin"}, text="Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers in the jungle east of the tar pits. Young Diemetradons and Fledgling Pterrordax here drop Webbed Scales for Shizzle; loot them as you go", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=67.0, y=35.0},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={3881}, obj={1}, names={"Expedition Salvation"}, text="The Crate of Foodstuffs at the abandoned Ironstone Camp", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=68.5, y=36.5},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4289}, names={"The Apes of Un'Goro"}, text="Ride north along the east side to Fungal Rock, the gorilla lair. Gorillas, Stompers and Thunderers drop the pelts; they often come in pairs. Leave U'cha (in the cave) for later", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=66.0, y=16.5},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4243}, names={"Chasing A-Me 01"}, text="A-Me 01 sits at the foot of Fungal Rock", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=67.7, y=16.8},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4244}, names={"Chasing A-Me 01"}, zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=67.7, y=16.8},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4244}, names={"Chasing A-Me 01"}, text="Needs the Mithril Casing. No casing? Skip this and the escort", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=67.7, y=16.8},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4245}, names={"Chasing A-Me 01"}, zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=67.7, y=16.8},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4245}, names={"Chasing A-Me 01"}, text="Escort A-Me 01 back to Karna Remtravel. Gorillas attack her on the way; kill them quickly", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=46.4, y=13.4, path={{67.4,22.3},{54.6,22.3},{51.4,21.7}}},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4245}, names={"Chasing A-Me 01"}, text="Karna Remtravel", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=46.4, y=13.4},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4284}, names={"Crystals of Power"}, text="J.D. Collie. Still short of a colour? All four grow on the rise between the camp and the Northern Pylon (47-61, 8-20): loot them there and come back before you take the pylons", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=41.9, y=2.7},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4285,4287,4288}, names={"The Northern Pylon","The Eastern Pylon","The Western Pylon"}, text="J.D. Collie", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=41.9, y=2.7},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3883}, names={"Alien Ecology"}, text="Hol'anyee Marshal. She gives you the Scraping Vial", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=43.9, y=7.2},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4492}, names={"Lost!"}, text="Spraggle Frock", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=43.6, y=8.5},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4285}, names={"The Northern Pylon"}, text="The Northern Crystal Pylon, on the rise just east of the camp. Walking up to it completes the quest. Plain Pterrordax circle this rise: kill the ones you see for Beware of Pterrordax (you finish the 10 at the Gorishi hive later) and loot their Webbed Scales. Then ride south-west across the crater", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=56.5, y=12.5},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4501,4145}, obj={2,2}, names={"Beware of Pterrordax","Larion and Muigin"}, text="West side of the crater: Frenzied Pterrordax and Bloodpetal Trappers. The Frenzied Pterrordax also drop Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=32.0, y=40.0},
  {t="L", seg=18, lvl=51, text="Krakle's quest needs level 51. If you are not there yet, keep killing the Frenzied Pterrordax and Bloodpetal Trappers on this west side. Frost Nova, then Blizzard", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=32.0, y=45.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={974}, names={"Finding the Source"}, text="Krakle, at the Golakka Hot Springs", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=30.9, y=50.4},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4288}, names={"The Western Pylon"}, text="The Western Crystal Pylon", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=23.9, y=59.2},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={3882,4503}, names={"Roll the Bones","Shizzle's Flyer"}, text="Dinosaur Bone piles lie on the ground south of the pylon. Elder Diemetradons roam these bone fields: they drop bones and the Webbed Diemetradon Scales, and Frenzied Pterrordax here finish the Pterrordax scales. Stegodons (elite) roam here too, so give them room", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=33.0, y=72.0},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={3881}, obj={2}, names={"Expedition Salvation"}, text="The Research Equipment at the abandoned south-west camp. Pull the nearby Stegodons away first or slip in between them", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=38.4, y=66.1},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={3883,4496,4501}, obj={0,0,1}, names={"Alien Ecology","Bungle in the Jungle","Beware of Pterrordax"}, text="The Gorishi hive in the south. Go in to a hatchery chamber with hanging larvae (48.7, 85.3) and use the Scraping Vial on the wall. Any Gorishi can drop the Scent Gland, and they drop soil too. Pterrordax circle the hive: finish the 10 for Beware of Pterrordax here", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=49.0, y=81.0},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={3761}, names={"Un'Goro Soil"}, text="You should have 20 Un'Goro Soil by now. Keep collecting until you have about 50", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=62.3, y=76.5},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4289}, names={"The Apes of Un'Goro"}, text="Ride east to Torwa Pathfinder at the crater entrance", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=71.6, y=76.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4292}, names={"The Bait for Lar'korwi"}, text="Torwa Pathfinder. Keep Torwa's Pouch: you fight Lar'korwi (level 56) on your way out of the crater, when you are higher level", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=71.6, y=76.0},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4301}, names={"The Mighty U'cha"}, text="U'cha (level 55) lives in the Fungal Rock cave. You kill him on the way out", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=71.6, y=76.0},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={4287}, names={"The Eastern Pylon"}, text="Ride north from Torwa along the eastern side to the Eastern Crystal Pylon on the ridge. Walking up to it completes the quest", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=77.2, y=50.0},
  {t="C", seg=18, q={974,4145}, obj={0,3}, names={"Finding the Source","Larion and Muigin"}, text="Ride west to Fire Plume Ridge, the volcano in the middle of the crater. Right-click Krakle's Thermometer at each hot spot until you find the hottest. Bloodpetal Flayers grow around its south and east base", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=47.8, y=49.1},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={974}, names={"Finding the Source"}, text="Back west to Krakle", zone="Un'Goro Crater", map=1449, x=30.9, y=50.4},
