  {t="C", seg=18, q={3517,3568,8252,5534}, names={"Stealing Knowledge","Seeping Corruption","The Siren's Coral","Kim'jael's \"Missing\" Equipment"}, text="Ruins of Eldarath, east of Valormok. The four tablets lie among the ruins (35-43, 44-65). Kill Spitelash Sirens and Myrmidons on the east side near the shore (about 45, 50): both drop Some Rune, and Sirens also drop the Enchanted Coral. The Warriors, Screamers and Serpent Guards in the west half drop neither. Use each numbered vial at its matching pool: #1 48.0, 61.0, #2 47.8, 51.4, #3 48.6, 48.5, #4 47.4, 46.2. Naga come in groups: Frost Nova, then Blizzard", zone="Azshara", map=1447, x=37.0, y=53.2},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={5534}, names={"Kim'jael's \"Missing\" Equipment"}, text="Ride back north-east to Kim'jael", zone="Azshara", map=1447, x=53.5, y=21.8, path={{43.0,49.0},{45.6,42.1},{45.0,35.8},{48.0,31.6},{48.2,28.0}}},
