  {t="C", seg=18, q={4294}, names={"... and a Batch of Ooze"}, text="Use your Un'Goro Slime Samples at the Testing Equipment next to Chemist Fuely until you have 5 Pure Un'Goro Samples. Still short after testing them all? Keep the quest and kill more oozes when the next segment takes you back to Un'Goro", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=47.5, y=73.3},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={4294}, names={"... and a Batch of Ooze"}, text="Chemist Fuely", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=47.5, y=73.3},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={4293}, names={"A Sample of Slime..."}, text="Chemist Fuely. You collect the Felwood slime samples next segment", zone="Undercity", map=1458, x=47.5, y=73.3},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=18, text="Undercity Magic Quarter: learn the level 52 spells"},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Teleport: Thunder Bluff (or fly there if you don't have it)"},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={3518}, names={"Delivery to Magatha"}, text="Magatha Grimtotem on Elder Rise", zone="Thunder Bluff", map=1456, x=69.8, y=30.9},
  {t="A", seg=18, q={3562}, names={"Magatha's Payment to Jediga"}, text="Magatha Grimtotem", zone="Thunder Bluff", map=1456, x=69.9, y=30.9},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={3786}, names={"Morrowgrain Research"}, text="Bashana Runetotem. Fewer than 10 Morrowgrain? Keep using the pouch and hand it in on a later Thunder Bluff visit", zone="Thunder Bluff", map=1456, x=71.1, y=34.2},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Teleport: Orgrimmar"},
  {t="FLY", seg=18, arg="Valormok", text="Doras, Orgrimmar's wind rider master"},
  {t="T", seg=18, q={3562,3563,3564,3565}, names={"Magatha's Payment to Jediga","Jes'rimon's Payment to Jediga","Andron's Payment to Jediga","Xylem's Payment to Jediga"}, text="Jediga", zone="Azshara", map=1447, x=22.6, y=51.4},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Optional dungeon: Blackmaw Hold, levels 55-60", text="New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is a furbolg city behind the big gate in Azshara. It has 5 Horde quests, but who gives them is not published yet: ask around Valormok and take what is offered; the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.", dg=20, run=true},
  {t="L", seg=18, lvl=53, text="Quest XP runs short. Grind the Spitelash Sirens and Myrmidons in the Ruins of Eldarath to 53 before you leave Azshara; this is TUGs' Azshara grind spot", zone="Azshara", map=1447, x=42.0, y=52.0, path={{28.6,49.9},{31.6,47.2},{33.2,43.6},{34.8,43.6},{36.6,46.3},{42.2,46.0},{43.0,49.3}}},
  {t="N", seg=18, arg="Segment done. Next segment flies from Valormok to Splintertree for Felwood", text="Keep 3908, 980, 4147 and 4293 in the log. Your hearthstone is set to Orgrimmar"},
  {t="FLY", seg=19, arg="Splintertree Post", text="You start at Valormok, level 53, with your hearthstone set to Orgrimmar. Kroum is the wind rider master"},
  {t="G", seg=19, text="Ride west from Splintertree to the main road and follow it north into Felwood. The Emerald Sanctuary is the first camp past the border", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=50.9, y=85.0},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={8460}, names={"Timbermaw Ally"}, text="Grazle, beside the road just south of the Emerald Sanctuary. If he offers a Timbermaw Ally that asks for 5 of each furbolg instead (Forever lists a new 6131), take that one; the logger records it", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=50.9, y=85.0},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={5155}, names={"Forces of Jaedenar"}, text="Greta Mosshoof, Emerald Sanctuary", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=51.2, y=82.1},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={4102}, names={"Cleansing Felwood"}, text="Maybess Riverbreeze, on the west side of the camp", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=46.8, y=83.1},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={8460}, names={"Timbermaw Ally"}, text="Deadwood Village, west of the road just south of the camp: Warriors, Pathfinders and Gardeners. Each kill also raises Timbermaw reputation, which you need for the tunnel later. Leave Overlord Ror (the big one at the south end) until you have his quest from Bloodvenom Post", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=47.5, y=91.0},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={8460}, names={"Timbermaw Ally"}, text="Grazle", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=50.9, y=85.0},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={8462}, names={"Speak to Nafien"}, text="Grazle. Nafien waits at the north end of Felwood", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=50.9, y=85.0},
  {t="N", seg=19, arg="Kill the slimes you pass from now on", text="Cursed Oozes (41, 71) and Tainted Oozes (42, 47) sit beside the road. Collect 15-20 Felwood Slime Samples for Chemist Fuely's test in the Undercity (4293): not every sample tests as corrupted, you need 5 that do, and the route does not come back to Felwood after the Undercity. They stack, so spares cost nothing"},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={5155}, names={"Forces of Jaedenar"}, text="Jaedenar, west of the road: the hounds, guardsmen, adepts and cultists near the entrance. Don't go deep yet", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=38.0, y=61.0},
  {t="F", seg=19, arg="Bloodvenom Post", text="Brakkar, the wind rider master, a little further north", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=34.4, y=53.8},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={4505}, names={"Well of Corruption"}, text="Winna Hazzard", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=34.2, y=52.3},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={4521}, names={"Wild Guardians"}, text="Trull Failbane. His owlbeasts are in Winterspring", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=34.7, y=52.8},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={6162}, names={"A Husband's Last Battle"}, text="Dreka'Sur. Overlord Ror is in Deadwood Village; you pass it again soon", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=34.8, y=52.7},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={4505}, names={"Well of Corruption"}, text="The corrupted moonwell at the Ruins of Constellas, south-west of Jaedenar. Use Winna's flask at the well; Jadefire satyrs guard it", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=32.3, y=66.5},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={4505}, names={"Well of Corruption"}, text="Back to Winna Hazzard, Bloodvenom Post", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=34.2, y=52.3},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={4506}, names={"Corrupted Sabers"}, text="She hands you a kitten", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=34.2, y=52.3},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={4506}, names={"Corrupted Sabers"}, text="Same moonwell at the Ruins of Constellas. Release the kitten at the well, wait until it has changed, then take it back", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=32.3, y=66.5},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={4506}, names={"Corrupted Sabers"}, text="Winna Hazzard. Click the cat at her feet to finish", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=34.2, y=52.3},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={5155}, names={"Forces of Jaedenar"}, text="Ride back south along the road to Greta Mosshoof, Emerald Sanctuary", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=51.2, y=82.1},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={5157}, names={"Collection of the Corrupt Water"}, text="Greta gives you an Empty Canteen", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=51.2, y=82.1},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={5157}, names={"Collection of the Corrupt Water"}, text="The moon well in the middle of Jaedenar. Clear a path to it and fill the canteen", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=35.2, y=59.8},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={5157}, names={"Collection of the Corrupt Water"}, text="Back to Greta Mosshoof", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=51.2, y=82.1},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={5158}, names={"Seeking Spiritual Aid"}, text="Islen Waterseer is on the Barrens coast; you see her later in this segment", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=51.2, y=82.1},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={6162}, names={"A Husband's Last Battle"}, text="Overlord Ror, at the south end of Deadwood Village, just south of the camp. Take his claw", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=48.2, y=94.3},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={6162}, names={"A Husband's Last Battle"}, text="Dreka'Sur, Bloodvenom Post, as you ride north", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=34.8, y=52.7},
  {t="G", seg=19, text="Ride north past Bloodvenom Post on the main road. The Tainted Oozes here count for the slime samples", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=42.0, y=47.0},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={4102}, names={"Cleansing Felwood"}, text="Irontree Cavern, north-east of Irontree Woods: Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders drop Blood Amber. Dessecus (rare elite) walks the cave, so stay near the mouth", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=57.5, y=22.0, path={{42.0,45.1},{43.8,42.4},{48.4,38.2},{50.8,30.4},{53.2,28.3},{56.8,22.0},{56.5,16.5}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={8462}, names={"Speak to Nafien"}, text="Nafien, outside Timbermaw Hold at the far north end of the road", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=64.8, y=8.1},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={8461}, names={"Deadwood of the North"}, text="Nafien", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=64.8, y=8.1},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={8461}, names={"Deadwood of the North"}, text="Felpaw Village, just west of Nafien: Den Watchers, Avengers and Shamans. Frost Nova, then Blizzard", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=61.5, y=8.0},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={8461}, names={"Deadwood of the North"}, text="Nafien", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=64.8, y=8.1},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={8465}, names={"Speak to Salfa"}, text="Nafien", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=64.8, y=8.1},
  {t="L", seg=19, lvl=54, text="Quest XP is far behind in this segment. Grind Felpaw Village to 54: the Deadwood furbolgs stand in packs and every kill adds Timbermaw reputation as well. Keep every Runecloth they drop and don't vendor it: Meilosh inside Timbermaw Hold wants 30 for a quest later", zone="Felwood", map=1448, x=61.5, y=8.0},
  {t="N", seg=19, arg="Open the Reputation tab and check Timbermaw Hold before going in", text="It must be Unfriendly or better, or the furbolgs inside attack you. Still Hostile? Kill more Deadwood furbolgs here until it changes. Got Deadwood Headdress Feathers? Nafien takes them 5 at a time (Feathers for Nafien, repeatable, about 550 XP and Timbermaw reputation each); bring later sets on your next tunnel passes"},
  {t="N", seg=19, arg="Keep any Deadwood or Winterfall Ritual Totem that drops (8470 / 8471)", text="Deadwood and Winterfall furbolgs drop them rarely. Once Timbermaw Hold is Neutral, right-click the totem and hand it to Kernda inside the Hold (Felwood 65.5, 3.5) on one of your tunnel trips"},
  {t="G", seg=19, text="Go through Timbermaw Hold and take the Winterspring exit. Never attack the Timbermaw furbolgs inside", zone="Winterspring", map=1452, x=27.7, y=34.5},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={8465}, names={"Speak to Salfa"}, text="Salfa, at the tunnel exit", zone="Winterspring", map=1452, x=27.7, y=34.5},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={8464}, names={"Winterfall Activity"}, text="Salfa. Winterfall Shaman and Ursa live in Winterfall Village in the east, next to Everlook", zone="Winterspring", map=1452, x=27.7, y=34.5},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={3908}, names={"It's a Secret to Everybody"}, text="Donova Snowden, beside the hot springs to the south-east. She offers The Videre Elixir next: skip it, it needs a long Feralas trip and the chain ends in an elite quest", zone="Winterspring", map=1452, x=31.3, y=45.2},
  {t="T", seg=19, q={980}, names={"The New Springs"}, text="Donova Snowden", zone="Winterspring", map=1452, x=31.3, y=45.2},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={4842}, names={"Strange Sources"}, text="Donova Snowden. You check the far south of Winterspring later on this pass", zone="Winterspring", map=1452, x=31.3, y=45.2},
  {t="N", seg=19, arg="Kill the Winterfall furbolgs in the camp east of Donova (around 41, 44) until one drops an Empty Firewater Flask", text="Pathfinders, Totemics and Den Watchers all drop it. Right-click the flask"},
  {t="A", seg=19, q={5083}, names={"Winterfall Firewater"}, text="The Empty Firewater Flask", zone="Winterspring", map=1452, x=41.0, y=44.0},
