  {t="N", seg=19, arg="Still carrying ... and a Batch of Ooze (4294) from last segment? Kill oozes here until you have 15-20 Un'Goro Slime Samples", text="Skip this if you handed it in last segment. Any Un'Goro ooze drops them. Closest: Primal Oozes just south of Marshal's Refuge (around 46, 24) and Glutinous Oozes to the south-west (around 35, 30); Muculent Oozes sit east of the camp (62-74, 25-35). Not every sample tests as pure and you need 5 that do. They stack"},
