  {t="A", seg=19, q={5281}, names={"The Restless Souls"}, text="Caretaker Alen. You only have to find Egan, who stands outside by the Plaguewood termite mounds you visit anyway. Take just this first part: his follow-up is inside Stratholme", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=69.9, y=53.7},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={6022}, names={"To Kill With Purpose"}, text="Corin's Crossing, west of Light's Hope. Gather 7 Living Rot within 10 minutes and grind them with Nathanos' Mortar and Pestle. The Gibbering Ghouls here also count for Carlin: each one releases a Darrowshire Spirit when it dies, so talk to the spirit to free it. There are only 8 of them, so you finish the 15 spirits later in Plaguewood", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=52.0, y=57.0},
  {t="L", seg=19, lvl=58, text="Grind Corin's Crossing to 58, TUGs' grind spot here: ghouls, Dark Casters and Plaguehounds in tight groups (Frost Nova, then Blizzard). Keep freeing the spirits the respawned Gibbering Ghouls leave. The north of the zone is level 58-60", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=52.0, y=57.0},
  {t="C", seg=19, q={5544}, names={"Carrion Grubbage"}, text="Carrion Devourers in the north-east toward Northdale; the Carrion Grubs around Corin's Crossing also count. Diseased Flayers stand right next to them (around 57, 31) and release Darrowshire Spirits too", zone="Eastern Plaguelands", map=1423, x=58.5, y=25.0, path={{54.6,57.0},{56.4,53.1},{56.4,49.0},{53.6,48.1},{52.6,45.1},{52.6,40.0},{55.0,36.4},{55.6,31.9},{58.8,26.8}}},
