  {t="C", seg=19, q={8278,8279,8281,8318}, names={"Noggle's Last Hope","The Twilight Lexicon","Stepping Up Security","Secret Communication"}, text="The west and south-west, as one loop. Twilight Keepers carry the Lexicon chapters: Havunth (around 41, 42), Mayna (26, 37) and Exeter (16, 86). Dredge Crushers and Stonelash Pincers roam the west, Stonelash Flayers and Rock Stalkers the south-west. Every Twilight cultist can drop Encrypted Twilight Texts: collect 10 for Bor. They stop dropping at 10; keep them, Ortell's next quest takes them first", zone="Silithus", map=1451, x=30.0, y=60.0},
